OL,3,GNEWSAMobile phone signal 'a nightmare',
OL,4,Avillager says
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has described the mobile phone
OL,7,Fsignal in her village as an "absolute
OL,8,Fnightmare".
OL,10,FPat Ferguson, 75, lives in Preston,
OL,11,Fjust three miles east of Hull, but said
OL,12,Fshe had to call people back on her
OL,13,Flandline, which added to her costs.
OL,15,F"It's always been a poor signal and
OL,16,Fthat's 26 years I would think," she
OL,17,Fsaid. "It's constricting in so many
OL,18,Fways."
