OL,3,GNEWSAMobile phone signal 'a nightmare',
OL,4,Avillager says
OL,5,
OL,6,FA government spokesperson said the East
OL,7,FRiding of Yorkshire had 97%
OL,8,Fgeographical 4G coverage from all four
OL,9,Fmobile operators, "but we know there is
OL,10,Fmore to do to improve connectivity in
OL,11,Fevery area".
